    'Required schema: {"action":"dynamic_data","targetId":"exact inventory elementId","fieldKey":"exact compatible inventory fieldKey","expression":"one exact runtime-available Bricks tag","answer":"brief user-facing result","mutationTitle":"short title","changeSummary":"exact binding applied","confidence":"high|medium|low","reason":"short reason"}',
    'Select intent only. Do not construct a patch, link object, or image object. If target, tag, placement, or context is unresolved, return {"action":"invalid","reason":"concise reason"}.',
