    lines.push('');
    lines.push('Answer the latest user request as a continuation when appropriate. The current user message has priority. For ordinal references such as “the second question/request/thing”, count the non-null groundedRequestSequence labels when they are present; unrelated prior Design actions do not change that ordinal. Return sourceUserSequence as the selected row\'s absolute labelled userSequence for verifier matching. Fall back to userSequence only when no grounded request labels exist. Do not repeat earlier answers unless asked.');
