    lines.push('The nativeAbilities read/write lists describe routes available for the selected skills. Only nativeAbilities.evidence contains reads that actually ran; never claim another native result. Native write abilities are planning metadata only here: keep mutations in the returned controlled action schema so Pixflow Apply, persistence verification, and rollback remain authoritative.');
